1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,850
ActTrader can show the latest market news next to your chart.

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:08,770
Open Panels on the right.

3
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:13,850
Switch on News panel.

4
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:18,210
The news appears on the right, newest first.

5
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:22,570
Each story shows where it came from and when.

6
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:28,490
Click a headline to read the full story in your web browser.

7
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:32,350
Scroll down for older stories.

8
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:35,850
You can choose your news sources under News Feeds.

